sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    Note over P,UI: Requires UC-02: a wayside is selected.
    P->>UI: click Load .plc file, choose program.plc
    UI->>S: loadProgramFromUrl(url)
    S->>S: loadProgramFromPath(url.toLocalFile())
    S->>S: loadProgramFromPath internal: path.open().read()
    alt the file cannot be read (OSError)
        S->>S: loadProgramFromPath internal: _log(could not read program.plc)
        S-->>UI: emit terminalChanged
    else read
        S->>S: loadProgramFile(name, source)
        S->>S: loadProgramFile internal: buffer := source, clear the last RUN and its diagnostics
        S-->>UI: emit bufferChanged, terminalChanged
        UI-->>P: program in the editor, NOT COMMITTED
    end
    Note right of S: Nothing reaches the wayside: the program still has to be run (run) and committed (commit).
